        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Sunday, November 9, 2025 | 7:00 PM | By Donation As part of the What These Eyes Have Seen – Witness to War exhibition, join us for an engaging evening that blends documentary film with live music in a tribute to veterans and their families. This special event showcases a selection of locally-produced short films [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
      }
